[3102]={["aftermath"]="Jorik noted the many organizations that coveted a rogue's skills, including SI:7 and the Defias. He urged independence rather than submission to their demands.",["atomIDs"]={"3102:description:1-94","3102:description:96-182","3102:description:184-271","3102:objective:1-92"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3102:completion:1-78","3102:completion:80-99","3102:completion:101-178","3102:completion:180-222","3102:completion:224-290","3102:completion:292-324","3102:completion:326-364","3102:completion:366-382","3102:completion:387-482","3102:completion:484-499"},["opening"]="A letter from Jorik awaited delivery after the kobold-camp assignment. McBride directed its reader toward the trainer at the stable behind Northshire Abbey.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to read the Encrypted Letter and speak to Jorik Kerridan behind the Abbey.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Encrypted Letter and met Jorik Kerridan.",["sourceClassMask"]="8",["sourceHash"]="7bfc431cdaca0127c0d97ec3ed827110e127cda6913db44298aa4377e3991ec9",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3103]={["aftermath"]="Anetta offered knowledge alongside an appeal to compassion. She placed responsibility for a better world in the actions of those living in it.",["atomIDs"]={"3103:description:1-94","3103:description:96-192","3103:description:194-281","3103:objective:1-75"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3103:completion:1-97","3103:completion:99-173","3103:completion:175-240"},["opening"]="Priestess Anetta's insignia marked a letter in McBride's keeping. The local priest trainer wanted its reader to visit her within Northshire Abbey.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to read the Hallowed Letter and speak to Priestess Anetta.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Hallowed Letter and met Priestess Anetta.",["sourceClassMask"]="16",["sourceHash"]="b3744cc25cef87509973d74c98d2f877c1f23d2c2bc18b93bd595d0606c4f513",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3104]={["aftermath"]="Khelden described the pursuit of magical knowledge as a path that could invite fear as well as respect. He promised further training as power grew.",["atomIDs"]={"3104:description:1-94","3104:description:96-181","3104:description:183-270","3104:objective:1-76"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3104:completion:1-59","3104:completion:61-94","3104:completion:96-124","3104:completion:126-237","3104:completion:242-301","3104:completion:303-368","3104:completion:370-414"},["opening"]="McBride passed on a letter from Khelden, Northshire's mage trainer. It called for a meeting inside the Abbey before its reader resumed other business.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to read the Glyphic Letter and speak to Khelden Bremen.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Glyphic Letter and met Khelden Bremen inside Northshire Abbey.",["sourceClassMask"]="128",["sourceHash"]="59cbfe4fa469b32476277ca4c720452460e6cea643f39b7f953213dd74f26e82",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3105]={["aftermath"]="Drusilla urged patience and self-command without abandoning ambition. She warned that dealings with creatures of the Twisting Nether made corruption a particular concern.",["atomIDs"]={"3105:description:1-94","3105:description:96-185","3105:description:187-274","3105:objective:1-80"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3105:completion:1-88","3105:completion:90-225","3105:completion:227-255","3105:completion:257-298","3105:completion:303-383"},["opening"]="A sealed letter from Drusilla had arrived for McBride's returning helper. Her message called a warlock to an introduction beside Northshire Abbey.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to read the Tainted Letter and speak to Drusilla La Salle.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Tainted Letter and met Drusilla La Salle next to the Abbey.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="a2e08d42e37cf18678b2d13be0c2aac071d1ab8712df7857c36b377643e87666",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3106]={["aftermath"]="Thran placed changing dwarven customs and the trogg threat within a warrior's new surroundings. He offered practical instruction as his pupil explored them.",["atomIDs"]={"3106:description:1-75","3106:description:77-125","3106:description:127-178","3106:description:180-252","3106:objective:1-68"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3106:completion:1-112","3106:completion:114-218","3106:completion:220-313","3106:completion:318-364","3106:completion:366-448"},["opening"]="Sten Stoutarm had been entrusted with a rune for the helper working beside him. He thought it came from Thran and pointed toward the warrior trainer inside Anvilmar.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to read the Simple Rune and speak to Thran Khorman.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Simple Rune and met Thran Khorman in Coldridge Valley.",["sourceClassMask"]="1",["sourceHash"]="3cac48de8fde42edd54911066d8b0177c0ba91d0618310ff17065128dcc1aed5",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3107]={["aftermath"]="Bromos praised the human tradition of the Holy Light and the difference one sacrifice could make. He offered training to prepare a paladin for the world outside.",["atomIDs"]={"3107:description:1-75","3107:description:77-125","3107:description:127-179","3107:description:181-253","3107:objective:1-75"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3107:completion:1-103","3107:completion:105-137","3107:completion:139-289","3107:completion:294-347","3107:completion:349-443","3107:completion:445-505"},["opening"]="A rune had reached Sten for delivery, apparently from Bromos. Its consecration marked a call to the paladin trainer inside Anvilmar.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to read the Consecrated Rune and speak to Bromos Grummner.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Consecrated Rune and met Bromos Grummner in Coldridge Valley.",["sourceClassMask"]="2",["sourceHash"]="66fc9576d9c54dd103d46b9212568c776fc818a60aa2ac8e58c37fdfedc4e267",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3108]={["aftermath"]="Thorgas demanded close knowledge of the world: animal companions, weapons, ammunition, and weather alike. His help could not replace a hunter's own attention.",["atomIDs"]={"3108:description:1-75","3108:description:77-125","3108:description:127-179","3108:description:181-253","3108:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3108:completion:1-90","3108:completion:92-262","3108:completion:267-331","3108:completion:333-389","3108:completion:391-416"},["opening"]="Sten held a rune he attributed to Thorgas, the hunter trainer. An introduction inside Anvilmar was the next task carried by its etched message.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to read the Etched Rune and speak to Thorgas Grimson.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Etched Rune and met Thorgas Grimson in Coldridge Valley.",["sourceClassMask"]="4",["sourceHash"]="2322cc067c51038f9b68f021e54c462a78eb074f67381da68a556d46887420f9",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3109]={["aftermath"]="Solm offered the tricks and maneuvers that kept a rogue alive. He also asked consideration for the gnomes displaced by Gnomeregan's destruction.",["atomIDs"]={"3109:description:1-75","3109:description:77-125","3109:description:127-175","3109:description:177-249","3109:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3109:completion:1-98","3109:completion:100-217","3109:completion:219-290","3109:completion:295-339","3109:completion:341-411","3109:completion:413-422","3109:completion:424-461"},["opening"]="A rune apparently sent by Solm had come through Sten's hands. The message called its reader to the rogue trainer inside Anvilmar.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to read the Encrypted Rune and speak to Solm Hargrin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Encrypted Rune and met Solm Hargrin in Coldridge Valley.",["sourceClassMask"]="8",["sourceHash"]="86468f05f1cb593b5e6e5083d9cba457e5f504d31b71cbb99b80d398442c3d43",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3110]={["aftermath"]="Branstock offered spells for defending the valley against troggs. He placed Ironforge and the Light behind his pupil's early training.",["atomIDs"]={"3110:description:1-75","3110:description:77-125","3110:description:127-181","3110:description:183-255","3110:objective:1-66"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3110:completion:1-83","3110:completion:85-230","3110:completion:235-298","3110:completion:300-345"},["opening"]="Sten had a rune from what he believed was Branstock, the priest trainer. Its reader was to take the message inside Anvilmar and meet him.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to read the Hallowed Rune and speak to Branstock Khalder.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Hallowed Rune and met Branstock Khalder in Anvilmar.",["sourceClassMask"]="16",["sourceHash"]="f542c777e3494e5d8d2e07770d43b0c3f0a49d22b2a346fae8c743c334f7d0b6",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3112]={["aftermath"]="Thran had promised to prepare the gnomes to reclaim their home. He offered his knowledge toward that purpose at an affordable cost.",["atomIDs"]={"3112:description:1-81","3112:description:83-131","3112:description:133-184","3112:description:186-258","3112:objective:1-74"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3112:completion:1-186","3112:completion:188-221","3112:completion:226-329","3112:completion:331-397","3112:completion:399-408"},["opening"]="A memorandum had been left with Sten while his helper was occupied. He identified Thran as its likely sender and directed its reader into Anvilmar.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to read the Simple Memorandum and speak to Thran Khorman.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Simple Memorandum and met Thran Khorman in Coldridge Valley.",["sourceClassMask"]="1",["sourceHash"]="014cd02f3a89456173a06b8477ccd4d833b6833f493b605dd0ce5c30f64db03a",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="64",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3113]={["aftermath"]="Solm treated solidarity as a kind of family despite Gnomeregan's loss. He kept a quiet profile and offered training to those who sought him out.",["atomIDs"]={"3113:description:1-81","3113:description:83-131","3113:description:133-181","3113:description:183-255","3113:objective:1-76"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3113:completion:1-170","3113:completion:175-206","3113:completion:208-268","3113:completion:270-321","3113:completion:323-355","3113:completion:357-443","3113:completion:445-450"},["opening"]="Sten passed along an encrypted memorandum he thought had come from Solm. The rogue trainer inside Anvilmar wanted a meeting with its reader.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to read the Encrypted Memorandum and speak to Solm Hargrin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Encrypted Memorandum and met Solm Hargrin in Coldridge Valley.",["sourceClassMask"]="8",["sourceHash"]="15fd9ac97f38793a7c4a14205e708234936451fd5ecb68f0e7a11b37502a554b",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="64",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3114]={["aftermath"]="Marryk's advice mixed spell fees with a request for ale. Beneath the casual manner, he plainly warned his pupil away from Gnomeregan.",["atomIDs"]={"3114:description:1-81","3114:description:83-131","3114:description:133-182","3114:description:184-256","3114:objective:1-96"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3114:completion:1-9","3114:completion:11-24","3114:completion:26-35","3114:completion:40-105","3114:completion:107-140","3114:completion:142-169","3114:completion:171-209","3114:completion:211-243","3114:completion:245-291","3114:completion:293-304"},["opening"]="Marryk's apparent memorandum had reached Sten for delivery. The mage trainer waited inside Anvilmar above Coldridge Valley.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to read the Glyphic Memorandum and speak to Marryk Nurribit.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Glyphic Memorandum and met Marryk Nurribit.",["sourceClassMask"]="128",["sourceHash"]="6559ece286d51b9cf9246d915b6d7adb61876df0301cb2535efd085cbeed39a0",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="64",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3115]={["aftermath"]="Alamar placed power in obedient allies who would serve through any task. He offered instruction in acquiring and commanding those servants.",["atomIDs"]={"3115:description:1-81","3115:description:83-131","3115:description:133-185","3115:description:187-259","3115:description:264-333","3115:objective:1-93"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3115:completion:1-25","3115:completion:27-79","3115:completion:81-118","3115:completion:120-173","3115:completion:175-182","3115:completion:184-198","3115:completion:200-265","3115:completion:270-300","3115:completion:302-359","3115:completion:361-428"},["opening"]="Sten passed on a memorandum from Alamar with a caution of his own: warlocks were distrusted nearby. The trainer awaited its reader inside Anvilmar.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to read the Tainted Memorandum and speak to Alamar Grimm.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Tainted Memorandum and met Alamar Grimm.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="74d9e55097864f0e1d2e7f31f0d9acf81b29d077e8cd8f78b58255f5443a3fbe",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="64",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3116]={["aftermath"]="Alyissia urged a measure of trust toward visitors of other races. Her immediate duty was to train a warrior who could aid her people.",["atomIDs"]={"3116:description:1-77","3116:description:79-145","3116:description:147-185","3116:objective:1-58"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3116:completion:1-118","3116:completion:120-136","3116:completion:138-168","3116:completion:170-253","3116:completion:258-286","3116:completion:288-344","3116:completion:346-377","3116:completion:379-443","3116:completion:445-511"},["opening"]="A messenger from Alyissia had given Ilthalaine a sigil for a new warrior. Its reader was to bring it to her in Shadowglen.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to read the Simple Sigil and speak to Alyissia.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Simple Sigil and met Alyissia in Shadowglen.",["sourceClassMask"]="1",["sourceHash"]="1fe75d2ae97a3bd4a44296e36ec1e7187887c8928ab903d6bb1a7333c2b89415",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3117]={["aftermath"]="Ayanna offered help in understanding a hunter's role. She warned against taking animal companions' skills for granted in a dangerous world.",["atomIDs"]={"3117:description:1-74","3117:description:76-140","3117:description:142-180","3117:objective:1-91"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3117:completion:1-160","3117:completion:165-310","3117:completion:312-348"},["opening"]="Ilthalaine held a sigil sent through Ayanna's messenger. The hunter trainer wanted its reader to find her high in Aldrassil.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to read the Etched Sigil and speak to Ayanna Everstride at the top of Aldrassil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Etched Sigil and met Ayanna Everstride.",["sourceClassMask"]="4",["sourceHash"]="8fda3c4ef254de0e43ed0f971ca35cae72c7e93ed267da59c691c940930396b4",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3118]={["aftermath"]="Frahun described peace with other races as fragile and repeated talk of Horde efforts to worsen distrust. That uncertainty, he argued, made skilled rogues necessary.",["atomIDs"]={"3118:description:1-73","3118:description:75-139","3118:description:141-179","3118:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3118:completion:1-78","3118:completion:80-226","3118:completion:228-241","3118:completion:246-358","3118:completion:360-444"},["opening"]="Frahun's messenger had entrusted Ilthalaine with an encrypted sigil. The rogue trainer called its reader to a conversation in Shadowglen.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to read the Encrypted Sigil and speak to Frahun Shadewhisper.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Encrypted Sigil and met Frahun Shadewhisper.",["sourceClassMask"]="8",["sourceHash"]="f2401d5e15e419154f81053b2c8f6406965454d7abe218c00aa595d0e6c64978",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3119]={["aftermath"]="Shanda kept her pupil's attention on Shadowglen before the wider world. She advised meeting and helping its people, with further training available on return.",["atomIDs"]={"3119:description:1-74","3119:description:76-140","3119:description:142-180","3119:objective:1-57"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3119:completion:1-64","3119:completion:66-99","3119:completion:101-203","3119:completion:205-327"},["opening"]="A sigil from Shanda awaited its reader in Ilthalaine's keeping. The priest trainer called for an introduction in Aldrassil.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to read the Hallowed Sigil and speak to Shanda.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Hallowed Sigil and met Shanda in Aldrassil.",["sourceClassMask"]="16",["sourceHash"]="c0ae2a775a9685bc82e5d21297b8d57603c0a2b5075f56f22be821081e7c1a7c",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3120]={["aftermath"]="Mardant undertook to interpret the spirits' messages and the Emerald Dream. He reserved deeper understanding of the sleeping trance for a pupil's growth.",["atomIDs"]={"3120:description:1-74","3120:description:76-141","3120:description:143-181","3120:objective:1-91"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3120:completion:1-40","3120:completion:42-189","3120:completion:194-268","3120:completion:270-375"},["opening"]="Ilthalaine passed on a verdant sigil from Mardant's messenger. It drew a druid toward a first meeting with the trainer in Aldrassil.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to read the Verdant Sigil and speak to Mardant Strongoak.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} read the Verdant Sigil and met Mardant Strongoak in Aldrassil.",["sourceClassMask"]="1024",["sourceHash"]="e86525dba6c9cd2d328a313ed681a5cf839fabcfe33d94dd857a53adee91cd78",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
