[3122]={["atomIDs"]={"3122:description:1-23","3122:description:25-57","3122:description:62-124","3122:objective:1-61"},["bridge"]="The shrunken head had reached Neeru in the agreed exchange. His prepared Herb Pouch was now ready to return to Uzer'i's undisclosed work in Feralas.",["bridgeFrom"]=3121,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Neeru accepted the exchange and supplied the herbs. His pouch, and word of his satisfaction with the head, were ready to return to Uzer'i in Feralas.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver Neeru's Herb Pouch to Uzer'i.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Neeru's Herb Pouch to Witch Doctor Uzer'i.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="4bd5b88c69eaa60a0728b069a75b942db1b5970c689d742d2dac31fe3332a347",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3123]={["aftermath"]="Uzer'i explained that a creature's muisek might escape violent death and seek revenge. He believed shrinking the fallen bodies prevented that escape and made the spirits available for his use.",["atomIDs"]={"3123:description:1-75","3123:description:77-97","3123:description:99-177","3123:description:182-298","3123:description:300-364","3123:description:366-459","3123:objective:1-50","3123:objective:52-127","3123:objective:132-212"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3123:completion:1-75","3123:completion:77-151","3123:completion:153-183"},["opening"]="Uzer'i proposed a trial of both his ritual and its bearer. A vessel could shrink fallen wildkin and capture their spirits before they escaped, requiring ten specimens from the Hinterlands.",["pending"]="{actor} would collect ten Wildkin Muiseks with the vessel and return both to Uzer'i.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered ten Wildkin Muiseks and the Muisek Vessel to Witch Doctor Uzer'i.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="4b5c0e80b9412bc37a943ea1aea7bad868e153dc3f4771141fb60d14a0409578",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3124]={["aftermath"]="Uzer'i warned that an escaped muisek might take the form of a greater creature. His explanation made containment a precaution against vengeance as well as a collection method.",["atomIDs"]={"3124:description:1-149","3124:description:154-265","3124:description:270-410","3124:description:412-486","3124:objective:1-99"},["bridge"]="The first vessel test had returned to Uzer'i. He now wanted the steadfast spirits of ten Frayfeather Hippogryphs captured in the High Wilderness.",["bridgeFrom"]=3123,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3124:completion:1-110","3124:completion:112-153","3124:completion:158-202","3124:completion:204-237"},["opening"]="Uzer'i chose hippogryph spirits for their loyalty and steadfastness beside the night elves. Ten fallen Frayfeathers in the High Wilderness were to be captured quickly enough to preserve their muisek.",["pending"]="{actor} would capture the muisek of ten Frayfeather Hippogryphs with the vessel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the vessel assignment involving ten Frayfeather Hippogryphs.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="3cb2a33b4a67966b13c2f4a247601d75f02e3e955104d2b5cc86943918c366bb",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3125]={["aftermath"]="The captured faerie-dragon spirits made their power available to Uzer'i's undertaking, in his account. He still had further work to request.",["atomIDs"]={"3125:description:1-139","3125:description:141-219","3125:description:221-307","3125:description:312-334","3125:description:336-401","3125:description:403-440","3125:objective:1-40","3125:objective:42-111"},["bridge"]="The hippogryph collection had reached Uzer'i. His next demand sought eight faerie-dragon muiseks, a strength he believed the creatures' fragile appearance concealed.",["bridgeFrom"]=3124,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3125:completion:1-14","3125:completion:16-85","3125:completion:90-139"},["opening"]="The apparent fragility of faerie dragons concealed the powerful spirits Uzer'i sought. He wanted the Horde to benefit from that strength through eight captured darters or sprite dragons west of camp.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to capture eight faerie dragon muiseks with the vessel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the vessel assignment involving eight Sprite Darters or Sprite Dragons.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b0955febc2bf3752d7184d14a94e4b0311b49788d0be53822dda0185597d70d1",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3126]={["aftermath"]="Uzer'i regarded the muisek collection as nearly complete. The treants' return left one more kind of power to seek.",["atomIDs"]={"3126:description:1-101","3126:description:103-173","3126:description:175-245","3126:description:250-308","3126:description:313-409","3126:objective:1-32","3126:objective:34-96"},["bridge"]="The faerie-dragon spirits had joined the collection. Uzer'i next turned to three Wandering Forest Walkers, seeking the protective power the night elves used against the Horde.",["bridgeFrom"]=3125,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3126:completion:1-14","3126:completion:16-56"},["opening"]="Wandering Forest Walkers were the next spirits marked for capture. Uzer'i regarded their slow movement as secondary to their strength as protectors allied with the night elves.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to capture the muisek of three Wandering Forest Walkers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the vessel assignment involving three Wandering Forest Walkers.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="eb107f5d716d75aa9fc7ae81aeeaa305ad1592c8b18f3569751588c1d7a32d7f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3127]={["aftermath"]="With giants among the collected spirits, Uzer'i considered himself able to bind their muisek permanently into other things using the gathered materials.",["atomIDs"]={"3127:description:1-91","3127:description:96-203","3127:description:205-324","3127:description:329-369","3127:description:371-454","3127:objective:1-36","3127:objective:38-108"},["bridge"]="The treant spirits brought the collection near its end. Seven giants in the northwest remained as Uzer'i's final targets, their size promising the power he coveted.",["bridgeFrom"]=3126,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3127:completion:1-58","3127:completion:60-191"},["opening"]="Uzer'i's last targets were mountain giants in the northwest, whose size could be felt in the shaking ground. He coveted the power of those ancient night elf allies and demanded seven muiseks.",["pending"]="{actor} would capture seven Land Walker or Cliff Giant muiseks with the vessel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the vessel assignment involving seven Land Walkers or Cliff Giants.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="10f3fd2bf057ee3dfe0bad0fe0f63b01d8e840fe31f43163d00e6218bc997c5a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3128]={["atomIDs"]={"3128:description:1-56","3128:description:58-115","3128:description:120-171","3128:description:173-265","3128:description:267-365","3128:description:367-462","3128:objective:1-142"},["opening"]="The spirit work also needed physical materials. Logs, encrusted minerals, sinew and metal from the same distant creatures could be gathered alongside Uzer'i's other tasks.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to obtain two logs, six minerals, twenty sinews and forty metallic fragments for Uzer'i.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered two Splintered Logs, six Encrusted Minerals, twenty Resilient Sinews and forty Metallic Fragments to Uzer'i.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="74af90578ce956b5bca555ff5fc5fa485f60459ad10adca21b0dc4b8994d705e",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3129]={["aftermath"]="Uzer'i announced the spirits sealed into the weapons. Their energy, in his account, was now available to the wielder through the completed craft.",["atomIDs"]={"3129:description:1-59","3129:description:61-169","3129:description:171-209","3129:objective:1-81"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3129:completion:1-38","3129:completion:40-123","3129:completion:128-170","3129:completion:172-183"},["opening"]="The gathered muisek and materials had brought Uzer'i to the difficult work of imbuing weapons. He asked for a moment to carry out the process.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to wait while Uzer'i prepared the weapons.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the wait for Witch Doctor Uzer'i's weapon preparation.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8df3cfab6082f2c9598bcc285d0b96f92a81b4b15b4e4fcfca99d7d94e6516ca",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3130]={["atomIDs"]={"3130:description:1-65","3130:description:68-124","3130:description:127-349","3130:description:354-379","3130:description:382-404","3130:description:407-417","3130:description:422-438","3130:objective:1-57"},["bridge"]="The Solarsal report had reached Shandris. She balanced the naga threat against the stronghold's exposure and sent the next consultation to Latronicus, who had watched their forces closely.",["bridgeFrom"]=2867,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Shandris had to weigh action against the naga against leaving Feathermoon exposed. While she assessed the broader danger, Latronicus's close watch on the enemy made him the next officer to consult.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to report to Latronicus Moonspear.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported to Latronicus Moonspear at Feathermoon Stronghold.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="69947660dc10cdac7aa38f9149d2e1611f91938174bdb9ddef4a1e0e6c308422",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3141]={["atomIDs"]={"3141:description:1-29","3141:description:31-69","3141:objective:1-44"},["opening"]="Loramus required more than a request to fight demons. His own account had to be heard before he would guide the struggle against them.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to hear Loramus's story.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} listened to the demon hunter's account.",["sourceHash"]="112e53a490d490d6a51018dc2da8bef0269f74cf4b0f0b6bebe418958fb1b13d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3161]={["atomIDs"]={"3161:description:1-57","3161:description:62-210","3161:description:212-303","3161:description:308-398","3161:description:403-471","3161:description:473-510","3161:objective:1-76"},["opening"]="Marvon's science left room for treasure hunting. Old troll ornaments modeled on Gahz'rilla offered both interests, and his detector could help locate thirty carved pieces for study.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather thirty Gahz'ridian Ornaments for Marvon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered thirty Gahz'ridian Ornaments to Marvon Rivetseeker.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="297be5f3093342db7df321346668c88af939ed7713846d6bc85461a4c0a65388",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3181]={["aftermath"]="Pebblebitty rejected the horn as a fake and claimed Margol's real horn was far larger.",["atomIDs"]={"3181:description:1-52","3181:description:54-110","3181:description:115-196","3181:description:198-242","3181:description:247-282","3181:description:287-367","3181:description:372-377","3181:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3181:completion:1-24","3181:completion:26-42","3181:completion:47-190","3181:completion:192-248","3181:completion:250-286"},["opening"]="A broken axe head lodged in the scratched horn bore Pebblebitty's name. The metal shattered during examination, but the enormous horn remained to identify.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to show the horn to Pebblebitty.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the horn to the mountaineer.",["sourceHash"]="0cc955a2b2a56b2f823f87fb0c8f8e54658c69635f9158a155cb3fdb5388d386",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3182]={["aftermath"]="Thorius recognized Margol the Rager's horn and its significance to archaeologists in Searing Gorge. The disputed trophy had reached a knowledgeable examiner.",["atomIDs"]={"3182:description:1-43","3182:description:45-122","3182:description:127-189","3182:description:191-254","3182:description:256-330","3182:description:335-344","3182:objective:1-60"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3182:completion:1-12","3182:completion:17-42","3182:completion:44-83","3182:completion:85-121","3182:completion:123-202","3182:completion:207-220"},["opening"]="Pebblebitty doubted the gigantic horn was genuine and expected her broken axe head still to be lodged in it. Curator Thorius could validate the disputed trophy before any key to Searing Gorge was granted.",["pending"]="{actor} would take Margol's Gigantic Horn to Curator Thorius.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Margol's Gigantic Horn to Curator Thorius for validation.",["sourceHash"]="119b65b0547cff301eb2897b08a1880c057fd6791b043c42fc2b6ce92b287936",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3201]={["atomIDs"]={"3201:description:1-65","3201:description:67-113","3201:description:115-200","3201:description:205-232","3201:description:234-307","3201:description:312-365","3201:description:370-381","3201:description:383-420","3201:objective:1-55"},["opening"]="Thorius authenticated the horn and prepared the required document. The Proof of Deed was ready to take back to the mountaineer who had doubted the trophy.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to return the Proof of Deed to Pebblebitty.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Proof of Deed to Mountaineer Pebblebitty.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="1ce120b9c488eeb27494f43b474d2a060260734b195199e6937e023db87ca67b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3221]={["atomIDs"]={"3221:description:1-86","3221:description:89-188","3221:objective:1-49"},["opening"]="Hadrec had received a summons from Renferrel without its details. The apothecary wanted to revisit the matter of the wolf hearts.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to answer Renferrel's summons.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Renferrel at the Sepulcher.",["sourceHash"]="8307e72331c45ff04cd7694469c692990ab5b934dd0e92d3c0bab4eaf53fbfce",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3261]={["atomIDs"]={"3261:description:1-30","3261:description:33-116","3261:description:119-149","3261:objective:1-40"},["opening"]="Sergra ended her instruction by naming another teacher. Jorn at Camp Taurajo would carry the hunter's guidance beyond the Crossroads.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to continue the lessons with Jorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Jorn at Camp Taurajo.",["sourceHash"]="635293709f7510f7c86c2d2936e12acb53f0a721c4ebc0abf49e2f91e5eee995",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3281]={["aftermath"]="Gazrog accepted the find as confirmation of the raptors' hiding place and said the guards' next pay depended on its recovery.",["atomIDs"]={"3281:description:1-77","3281:description:80-188","3281:description:191-245","3281:description:250-306","3281:description:309-342","3281:objective:1-52"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3281:completion:1-4","3281:completion:6-54","3281:completion:56-122","3281:completion:124-207","3281:completion:212-225","3281:completion:227-349"},["opening"]="The guards' payroll was still missing. Gazrog's reports placed a large nesting ground south of Ratchet, where he suspected the raptors had hidden the silver.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to search the Raptor Grounds for the silver.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the stolen silver to Gazrog.",["sourceHash"]="3c67ac6a275863712273a547b34ba886bf0bef3304cfa6c2da6c731d44570288",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3301]={["aftermath"]="Mura observed a lingering inner glow and undertook further study, hoping it could help Silverpine.",["atomIDs"]={"3301:description:1-92","3301:description:95-186","3301:description:189-271","3301:description:276-352","3301:description:355-386","3301:description:389-479","3301:objective:1-43"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3301:completion:1-17","3301:completion:19-80","3301:completion:82-89","3301:completion:91-114","3301:completion:119-132","3301:completion:134-219"},["opening"]="Tonga hoped the oasis shells might aid Mura's work in dying Silverpine. A sample would carry the Barrens inquiry across the sea to the Sepulcher.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Mura a shell sample.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Mura with the altered shell.",["sourceHash"]="06d20269423a21fc6e4666958fb9e1a2e5655bd3014f2cebca35fb6eeb14f708",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3321]={["aftermath"]="Trenton formally recognized his pupil as a blacksmith of the Mithril Order.",["atomIDs"]={"3321:description:1-37","3321:description:39-127","3321:description:129-207","3321:description:212-260","3321:description:262-298","3321:description:300-404","3321:objective:1-36"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3321:completion:1-60"},["opening"]="Trenton and Galvan regarded a dedicated smith as one of their own. Trenton prepared a small token whose familiar properties recalled the beginning of the pupil's dealings with the Mithril Order.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to wait while Trenton finished his work.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} waited for Trenton Lighthammer to complete his work.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="1640ae00cb673fe09dde35dcfe92ee0d134229f89b197b218f9525ec5d18b36d",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3341]={["aftermath"]="Andrew treated the lich's fate as a warning about the cost of unwavering service to the Scourge.",["atomIDs"]={"3341:description:1-73","3341:description:75-185","3341:description:190-261","3341:description:263-389","3341:description:394-472","3341:description:474-509","3341:objective:1-80"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3341:completion:1-40","3341:completion:42-106"},["opening"]="Andrew Brownell's newer findings made Razorfen Downs more than a quilboar stronghold. He reported a pact with the Scourge and a lich whose telepathic bond to Ner'zhul had to be severed.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to defeat Amnennar the Coldbringer and return his skull.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Amnennar the Coldbringer's skull to Andrew Brownell.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="cee4459d04c8f701721c8fc9a3cf6ad3dc7513261769dd44518411d47aa53adc",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3361]={["atomIDs"]={"3361:description:1-78","3361:description:81-173","3361:description:178-265","3361:description:268-299","3361:description:302-353","3361:description:356-412","3361:description:417-495","3361:objective:1-94"},["opening"]="Felix fled Gnomeregan's radiation only to lose his belongings to trolls near Anvilmar. His box, chest and bucket of bolts were scattered among their camps southwest of the settlement.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Felix's three missing containers from the troll camps.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Felix's Box, Chest and Bucket of Bolts to Felix Whindlebolt.",["sourceHash"]="494e0509a295e10915eeaf9b05bb2677778a6b77410f59977683ef2a4d51b727",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"}
